  "description": "World Atlantic's standard tail on a polished-metal MD-83: the navy fin with its green and light-blue rings, the green and light-blue bands round a navy tail cone, navy engines, 'World Atlantic' in navy above the forward windows and the isotype aft of the door, all on bare polished aluminum. The navy on the body is only a wedge under the tail, its top edge slanting from behind the fin's foot down to the belly under the engines; there's no light-blue line along it.",
