      ],
      "description": "World Atlantic's isotype (our own simplified mark, WAL/isotype): a green crescent like a swept wing, its long tip high and aft, bowing forward and ending in a point low and aft; a light-blue stroke from where it bows forward down to a point low and forward; a second light-blue stroke from the same place down to a point low and aft beside the green's; a small navy wedge where they meet. Just aft of the forward door, across the window line, its lower tips under the windows.",
      "reference": "https://www.flywaa.com/waa-isotype.svg",
      "confidence": "medium",
